== Trivia ==
*'''Vargul''', {{NPCSprite|Alchemist}} and {{NPCSprite|Sherry}} are the only [[Garden Visitors]] to have neither the sprite of a player nor a Villager.
* On {{zone|The Garden}}, '''Vargul''' visits as a regular sized zombie.

==Bugs==
* '''Vargul''' cannot be offered a {{item|Bachelor's Rose}}.

